(6984899, 1053693, 30982, '<td valign="top">Glad you avoided the cynical side.  Leave that to those of us who are by nature less enthusiastic about romance...  Congratulations on a wonderful Hallmark image some poor schmuck will have to go buy for his sweetie because the calendar says so.  :-)  (Seriously, another lovely 7 to add to your collection, along with another lovely ribbon.  And red for a valentine''s image is perfect!)</td>', 'Glad you avoided the cynical side.  Leave that to those of us who are by nature less enthusiastic about romance...  Congratulations on a wonderful Hallmark image some poor schmuck will have to go buy for his sweetie because the calendar says so.  :-)  (Seriously, another lovely 7 to add to your collection, along with another lovely ribbon.  And red for a valentine''s image is perfect!)', '2013-02-23 23:35:40.000000', NULL, 0),
